# Secrets and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.staging
**/.env*.local
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pkcs12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.p12
**/*.kdbx
**/*.keystore

# SSH & GPG
**/.ssh/**
**/.gnupg/**
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.pub
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ed25519.pub
**/id_ecdsa
**/known_hosts
**/authorized_keys

# Cloud & Auth Tokens
**/.aws/**
**/.azure/**
**/.gcloud/**
**/.config/gcloud/**
**/.docker/config.json
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.git-credentials
**/.netrc

# System & OS
/proc/**
/sys/**
/dev/**
/etc/shadow*
/etc/sudoers*
/var/log/**

# Build artifacts & dependencies (optional scan suppression)
**/node_modules/**
**/target/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.venv/**
